{
  "id": "01",
  "title": "基础与十神",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“基础与十神”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五干属阳，喜合。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-b717aa88d9c21adbbcff-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以甲为例见甲：为比肩、兄弟。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-90201b16959ceedcee84-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见乙：为劫财、败财，剋父及妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-9defb4a418f474cdef93-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见丙：为食神、天厨、寿星，为男。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-71d572f6bf5de1704628-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见丁：为伤官、退财、耗气，子甥。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-d5257cb9dc776919000b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见戊：为偏财、偏妻、偏妾，剋子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-aee63cec6cfe5060b0e9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见己：为正财、正妻，剋母，为合神。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-81e9e04c57777f9b36c2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见庚：为偏官、七杀、官鬼、将星。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-1c62e921923ce790cb22-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见辛：为正官、禄马、荣神，父母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-8e3a20084dd2c6a36134-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见壬：为倒食、偏印、梟神，剋女。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-5d935b1984036a739c9b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见癸：为印綬、正人、君子，产业。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-3f1698fdb0908ae4a33a-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "五干属阴，喜冲。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-9725b56c62d27f11c6e3-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "以乙为例见甲：为劫财、逐马，剋妻。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-315574c5eb8d85093271-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见乙：为比肩、兄弟、朋友。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-8af7692612692d6ec001-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见丙：为伤官、小人、盗气，为姪。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-cc32a1fcaa139cf606a2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见丁：为食神、天厨、寿星，子孙。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-14c1d67063feb621bc1b-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见戊：为正财、正妻，剋母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-edd77bf2ab4cf5c2c2cb-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见己：为偏财、偏妻、偏妾，剋子。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-140966a468243fb6eaf1-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见庚：为正官、禄马，剋父母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-6a5396c3bd21b4d57ed2-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见辛：为偏官、七杀、官鬼，媒人。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-0d88c92c364c35fc93c0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见壬：为印綬、正人、君子，忌杀。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-573b2fcc810d70aaa05f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "见癸：为倒食、偏印、梟神，剋母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "01-4a147c9bf4e5a4ac3d14-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
